### Public API documentation: https://ltp.cesnet.cz/api/
### Set ltpCesnetToken, ltpCesnetGroup and ltpCesnetId in a private HTTP client environment.
### Obtain an application token in the logged-in CESNET GUI. ProArc does not use Basic authentication.
### ProArc reads export.ltpCesnet.apiUrl/groupToken/catalogId from proarc.cfg.

### ProArc: validate and remember a token for the current user for at most eight hours
POST {{proarcUrl}}/rest/v2/export/cesnet/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

ltpCesnetToken={{ltpCesnetToken}}

### ProArc: local status (present, expiresAt); never returns the token
GET {{proarcUrl}}/rest/v2/export/cesnet/token

### ProArc: forget the current user's token; this does not revoke it at CESNET
DELETE {{proarcUrl}}/rest/v2/export/cesnet/token

### Account and group membership
GET https://ltp.cesnet.cz/api/auth/account/
Authorization: Token {{ltpCesnetToken}}

### List packages
GET https://ltp.cesnet.cz/api/v2/archive/?group={{ltpCesnetGroup}}&limit=100
Authorization: Token {{ltpCesnetToken}}

### Read upload and integrity statuses (both must succeed before catalog update)
GET https://ltp.cesnet.cz/api/v2/archive/{{ltpCesnetId}}/?group={{ltpCesnetGroup}}
Authorization: Token {{ltpCesnetToken}}

### List versions; use the returned version ID for download
GET https://ltp.cesnet.cz/api/v2/archive/versions/{{ltpCesnetId}}/?group={{ltpCesnetGroup}}
Authorization: Token {{ltpCesnetToken}}

### Prepare/download a version; repeat after HTTP 204 until HTTP 200 returns its S3 URL
GET https://ltp.cesnet.cz/api/v2/archive/{{ltpCesnetId}}/download/?group={{ltpCesnetGroup}}
Authorization: Token {{ltpCesnetToken}}

### ProArc: upload retained BagIt ZIPs (omit ltpCesnetToken to reuse the remembered token)
POST {{proarcUrl}}/rest/v2/export/cesnet
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

sourceBatchId={{bagitBatchId}}&ltpCesnetToken={{ltpCesnetToken}}

### ProArc: start an NDK export with automatic BagIt and CESNET upload
### No CESNET credentials are required for export/packaging. Upload will wait for a token.
POST {{proarcUrl}}/rest/v2/export/ndk
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

pid={{proarcPid}}&ltpCesnet=true

### ProArc: validate one token and release ALL waiting CESNET uploads, preserving original batch owners
### Requires allObjectsFunction AND importToCatalogFunction.
### Returns data[0].resumedBatchIds and data[0].failures. Omit the token to reuse this operator's cached token.
POST {{proarcUrl}}/rest/v2/export/cesnet/resume
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

ltpCesnetToken={{ltpCesnetToken}}

### If response.data[0].confirmationRequired=true, display response.data[0].warnings[].message and request user consent.
### On cancellation, send no further request. On consent, create a new independent package:
POST {{proarcUrl}}/rest/v2/export/cesnet
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

sourceBatchId={{bagitBatchId}}&confirmCesnetUpload=true

### ProArc: schedule a check process (allObjectsFunction); optional catalog writes use a separate process requiring importToCatalogFunction.
### Omit ltpCesnetToken to reuse the current user's cached token. Returns data[0].exportId; see process logs.
### catalogId is optional; packages submitted without it are never written to a catalog.
POST {{proarcUrl}}/rest/v2/export/cesnet/check
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

ltpCesnetToken={{ltpCesnetToken}}

### ProArc: find current CESNET states; ltpRecords tracks the current package ID
GET {{proarcUrl}}/rest/v2/object/search?type=ADVANCED&ltpState=cesnet:STORED
